          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "UX7xg",
          "name": "Subheading",
          "fill": "$text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "What the reference shows",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "S4o7M8",
          "name": "Bullet",
          "fill": "$text-2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "- The privacy sentence is .sr-only: sighted visitors never see the consent copy or the email-processor disclosure (gold box, drawn for the wireframe only).",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "tDMsE",
          "name": "Bullet",
          "fill": "$text-2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "- The sr-only copy says 'only email you about your Soleur waitlist spot'; the proposed copy names the wider use (updates) and Buttondown.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "xbkFG",
          "name": "Bullet",
          "fill": "$text-2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "- The only prominent CTA is a waitlist for a product that is not open yet. Self-hosting, the thing a visitor can do today, is a text link to the generic /getting-started/ page.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "kUHRU",
          "name": "Bullet",
          "fill": "$text-2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "- The two links share one row but go to unrelated places (a page vs the in-page #soleur-vs-copilots anchor) and the compare label names Copilot.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
